1
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:50,520
Shen Feng, you're really something.

2
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:51,200
How did you

3
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,080
collude with those stall owners?

4
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,160
I went to blow up balloons,

5
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:57,360
and there was a puzzle piece inside one!

6
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:59,560
And that blessing stall,

7
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:01,240
with so many sachets,

8
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:02,240
how did you know

9
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:04,280
I'd pick that exact one?

10
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,480
This is my turf.

11
00:01:05,519 --> 00:01:06,980
I have my own connections.

12
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:08,680
You really pulled it off.

13
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:10,520
So, did you have fun today?

14
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:11,440
I did!

15
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:15,280
Oh no, I was having so much fun
I lost track of time.

16
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:16,680
We won't get the best viewing spot now.

17
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:17,440
It's fine.

18
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,400
How can it be fine?

19
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:21,320
I know a place

20
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:22,840
where you can see the fireworks perfectly.

21
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:24,480
Did you finish your homework

22
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:26,480
before coming to see the fireworks?

23
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:28,160
Finished it ages ago.

24
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,640
Huo Huo,

25
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,680
where is this

26
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:32,539
best viewing spot you mentioned?

27
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:36,880
I want to buy clay figurines, a toy plane,

28
00:01:37,039 --> 00:01:39,479
and that biggest robot.

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:43,039
I also want sugar pancakes,
grilled sausages,

30
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:46,360
and a sweet cup of watermelon juice.

31
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:49,979
You're taking advantage of the situation,
aren't you?

32
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:53,320
Don't worry, I've got it all covered.

33
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,120
Let's go, follow me.

34
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,180
Let's go, Tangbao.

35
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,280
Come on, Tangbao.

36
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:01,880
I told you not to take that order,

37
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:02,920
the delivery is so far.

38
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,250
The system assigned it,

39
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,420
it's not good to reject it.

40
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:12,720
The fireworks show is about to start,
let's go.

41
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,160
This is it.

42
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:18,520
This is great,

43
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:19,800
it's high up above the venue.

44
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:22,560
This should be the place
with the best view.

45
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:29,640
Five, four, three, two, one.

46
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:34,880
Look!

47
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:35,920
It's starting, it's starting!

48
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:37,720
The fireworks are so beautiful.

49
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:40,620
Yue Shanchuan.

50
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,960
Lately,

51
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:45,320
I've put aside everything in my own life

52
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:46,880
to slowly walk toward you

53
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:48,320
and blend into your world.

54
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:49,520
I know you're someone

55
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,640
who takes everything seriously

56
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:53,600
and wouldn't start a relationship easily.

57
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:55,320
So I'll follow your pace.

58
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,880
Let's start by dating.

59
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:02,050
Would you like to go out with me?

60
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,360
What did you just say?

61
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,530
The fireworks are so beautiful today.

62
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:36,640
Look at that one. It's really pretty.

63
00:03:39,079 --> 00:03:41,320
And that one looks like a shooting star.

64
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:49,210
What are you looking at?

65
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,280
Can I kiss you?

66
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:34,280
Stupid mouth. Look what you've done.

67
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:35,920
You just had to kiss him,

68
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:36,920
didn't you?

69
00:04:38,159 --> 00:04:41,080
Am I sexually repressed or something?

70
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:43,440
No,

71
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:45,680
I need to get some meds from Dr. Feng.

72
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,250
Haven't seen him in a while.

73
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:54,080
Dr. Feng is still so capable.

74
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:08,520
Qingqing, snap out of it.

75
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:14,800
Sir, any new updates?

76
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,700
What do you want to see?

77
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:18,840
Can you shoot a video

78
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,640
from the neck down?

79
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:23,690
Preferably without showing
your head at all.

80
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:25,640
Why?

81
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:31,410
Seeing your head makes my mind wander.

82
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:32,640
Please,

83
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:33,680
I'm begging you.

84
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:37,210
I'll shoot it for you tomorrow.

85
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:41,680
It's fine, it's fine.

86
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,640
Some new content will fix me right up.

87
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:45,720
I'm just thirsty,

88
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,840
not looking for a relationship.

89
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,320
Tangbao, let's go, let's go. Tangbao.

90
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:18,600
I won't go to Shen Feng's place
for free meals these two days

91
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,860
to avoid awkwardness.

92
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:22,050
It's all Shen Feng's fault.

93
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:24,000
He should have pushed me away
when I leaned in.

94
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:24,840
How could he just stand there

95
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:26,040
and let me kiss him?

96
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,690
Now I have to eat this stuff.

97
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,010
What a coincidence.

98
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,260
Not a coincidence.

99
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,570
I'm waiting for you.

100
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,880
What, tired of my food?

101
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,159
No.

102
00:06:42,159 --> 00:06:42,880
Sometimes people

103
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:44,800
just want some junk food

104
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,680
for a change.

105
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:49,120
Do you want a change,
or are you afraid to see me?

106
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,800
You're joking.

107
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,440
Why would I be afraid to see you?

108
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:56,970
I didn't do anything wrong.

109
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,200
It's just having dinner at your place.

110
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:01,600
Let's go. Let's go
to your place for dinner.

111
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:04,220
Look at you, acting on impulse again.

112
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,700
I didn't mean to force you.

113
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,800
I'm not acting on impulse.

114
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:12,080
I was planning to go anyway. Let's go.

115
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,480
Thank you for today.

116
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:24,120
Huohuo.

117
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:26,680
Brother, did you sew this for me?

118
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,720
I don't have such good skills.

119
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:32,040
Then who could it be?

120
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:34,680
There was a hole in these pants
from riding my bike.

121
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:36,680
How did the wound heal itself?

122
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:38,640
This is pretty good craftsmanship.

123
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:40,280
Could it be a relative of yours

124
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:41,280
who helped sew it?

125
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:44,000
If relatives came, they would definitely
let us know in advance.

126
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,730
Who would come to our house quietly
to mend pants?

127
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:50,040
Speaking of which,
it's been really weird lately.

128
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:52,000
I always feel like
someone is following me.

129
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:54,730
When I went out to play,
my water bottle was empty,

130
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:57,000
and then someone filled it up again.

131
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,440
And you dared to drink it?

132
00:07:58,640 --> 00:08:01,800
Sister, I'm not a three or
four-year-old kid anymore.

133
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,920
Next year I'll be a nine-year-old adult.

134
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,680
I still have this basic common sense.

135
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:08,360
But Tangbao accidentally took a lick,

136
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,880
and it was fine.

137
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:11,320
Oh, right.

138
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:13,920
A few times I had my eye
on a toy in the store,

139
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:14,720
and a few days later,

140
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,280
the toy I liked

141
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:17,960
appeared at home.

142
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:20,600
Brother.

143
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,880
Do you think there's a fairy helping me?

144
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,520
I think it's not a fairy,

145
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:27,880
but a human trafficker.

146
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:29,960
Have you met any strangers

147
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:32,130
or weird people talking to you lately?

148
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:35,280
No, they're all people from the village,

149
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:38,080
or teachers and classmates from school.

150
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,640
I know them all.

151
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:44,480
This person can often appear
around Huohuo,

152
00:08:44,640 --> 00:08:46,840
and can even sneak into our house quietly.

153
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:49,160
It must be someone in our social circle.

154
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,040
Fairy, oh fairy,

155
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:57,460
I hope I can get full marks
in every subject on the next exam.

156
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,560
I hope my future homework can be done

157
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:01,040
without me writing it.

158
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:02,760
In your dreams.

159
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:05,320
From now on, you are not allowed
to leave my sight for a single step.

160
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,080
Hear me?

161
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:24,050
What's going on?

162
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:25,920
Circuit failure?

163
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:36,610
Looks like I really need to get someone
to check it tomorrow.

164
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,400
It's fine.

165
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:11,720
The breaker just tripped.

166
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,640
Ms. Qian,

167
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:24,800
God bless.

168
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,760
Evil spirits begone.

169
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:29,160
Begone, begone, begone!

170
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:31,880
Prosperity, democracy, civility, harmony,

171
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:34,210
freedom, equality, justice, rule of law!

172
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:38,200
Shen Feng, save me!

173
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:42,320
Shen Feng, open the door!

174
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:44,560
Shen Feng,

175
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:46,520
there's a ghost!

176
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:47,760
What's wrong? What happened?

177
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:50,920
There's a ghost at Yunbian! Help!

178
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,080
Why are you like Huo Huo,

179
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:54,680
always talking about ghosts all day?

180
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:56,160
I'm not lying to you. It's true.

181
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:57,160
Right over there.

182
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:58,320
Right there.

183
00:10:58,680 --> 00:10:59,320
Alright,

184
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:00,640
I'll go back and check it out with you.

185
00:11:00,640 --> 00:11:01,480
Let go of me first.

186
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,340
I don't want to.

187
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:03,160
I'm not going back today.

188
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:04,490
I'm staying right here.

189
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:12,600
What's poking me?

190
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,360
Stop touching.

191
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,080
I...

192
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:35,480
I know this mirror too well.

193
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:37,520
A lot of your mirror selfie videos

194
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:38,680
are in my favorites.

195
00:11:38,680 --> 00:11:41,040
And these wolf ears, I love them so much.

196
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,640
The cut-out rhinestone tank top.

197
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:45,480
This is what you wore the first time

198
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:48,010
when I ordered a custom video
from you, right?

199
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:49,680
Actually, I've suspected you for a while.

200
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:51,520
You gave yourself away a few times.

201
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:52,160
But

202
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:54,490
you managed to get away
with it every time.

203
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,650
I didn't want you to know back then.

204
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:57,840
I get it.

205
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,820
Everyone has their little kinks.

206
00:12:00,920 --> 00:12:03,080
I don't wear these because I like them,

207
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:04,600
but because you do.

208
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:12,080
You've been making videos for a while,

209
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,440
and the content is great.

210
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,720
But for so long,

211
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:16,280
I've been your only fan.

212
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:18,760
You made them on purpose just for me,

213
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:19,880
right?

214
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:21,800
You knew who I was all along.

215
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:24,000
You were the one
who deleted me completely back then.

216
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,440
I had no choice

217
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:27,040
but to play the long game to catch you.

218
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:29,160
Otherwise, did you think
I like taking my clothes off?

219
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:30,840
So if I like watching,

220
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:32,490
you'll let me watch?

221
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:40,140
What are you doing?

222
00:12:41,120 --> 00:12:42,240
Since we're already here,

223
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,360
dance for me

224
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:46,680
right here.

225
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:09,360
What are you trying to do?
